;;
; @file   ram.asm
; @brief  Named WRAM addresses: direct page pointers, $0900-$09FF game variables and the $7F1F00+ save-file block.
;         Variables inside structures live in structures.asm. Trailing comments give type, meaning and the routines that
;         write (W:) / read (R:) the variable, including accesses through raw addresses. Addresses from $7E08D1 up use
;         `+!RAM_SHIFT` (region.asm).
; @see    src/common/structures.asm, src/common/region.asm
;;
